{"type":"message","id":"603b37f6","parentId":"8e66a894","timestamp":"2026-06-19T05:59:12.491Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Fri 2026-06-19 05:58 UTC] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: PROJECT_SLUG: coinography\nPROJECT_CONFIG: /home/bhard/.openclaw/projects/coinography.json\nPIPELINE_MANIFEST: /tmp/coinography-run-20260619-053305-7578-24771/manifest.json\n\nRead the finished article from /tmp/coinography-run-20260619-053305-7578-24771/article/final.md.\nNo feature image available (was skipped).\nPublish to WordPress as a DRAFT for project coinography.\nCategories should be read from /tmp/coinography-run-20260619-053305-7578-24771/research/validated.json (wp_category_ids [177, 176] or fallback to blockchain category).\nWrite the WordPress URL to /tmp/coinography-run-20260619-053305-7578-24771/publish/wp-url.txt.\nReturn the WordPress draft URL on success."}],"timestamp":1781848752469}}
